  "context_markdown": "This register records known, intentional differences between the supplied printed source and the current working edition. The choices are adopted for this edition; they do not reconstruct the original transcriber’s intentions.\n\nThe review covers all four movements and all 22 pages of the supplied scan, with magnified checks of identified passages. It is not a new critical edition or an exhaustive guarantee of every small mark. The source is the Breitkopf & Härtel collected edition as reprinted by Dover, not an autograph. The scan’s printed pagination is 43–64; the catalogue description copied in the metadata gives 43–62.\n\nBar numbers restart in each movement and follow the native edition: first endings excluded from its count are not assigned new consecutive numbers. Pickups and split repeat bars retain the native numbering. The full physical-to-local map is retained with the working records. Images include context; captions identify the target bar(s).",
